  "_comment": [
    "A portfolio snapshot in the shape ib_async hands over, recorded so the",
    "repricing layer can be exercised without TWS. Figures are representative",
    "rather than a literal capture of any account. It is built to exercise the",
    "traps rather than to model a strategy: options both long and short, an",
    "AM-settled quarterly and a PM-settled weekly on the same morning, a future,",
    "an equity, and a bond quoted as a percentage of nominal — every case the",
    "engine has to handle, in one file.",
    "",
    "The option prices are Black-76 consistent with the implied volatilities at",
    "asof, rounded to the quarter-point tick, so `modelVsMarket` in the position",
    "report is a small quote-rounding residual and not an artefact of the",
    "fixture. `asof` is pinned rather than left as today, so these numbers price",
    "the same way next year as they do now."
